CHAIN            						_F_+^C
   <#bbbbbb>A two-hit clothesline attack that pulls opponents in
   on hit and block. Chain OK.</>
UNDERMINE            						_DF_+^C
   <#bbbbbb>A low sliding attack that goes under many
   other attacks.</>

